@startuml Class Diagram - Level 4 (US 2.2.2 - Vessel Management)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

' ===== Presentation Layer (Controllers) =====
package "Presentation Layer" #87CEEB {
    class VesselsController <<Controller>> {
        - _service: VesselService
        - _logger: ILogger
        - _errors: List
        + GetAll(filters): Task
        + GetByImoNumber(imo: string): Task
        + Create(dto: VesselDTO): Task
        + Update(imo: string, dto: VesselDTO): Task
    }
}

' ===== Application Layer (Services & DTOs) =====
package "Application Layer" #87CEEB {
    class VesselService <<Service>> {
        - _vesselRepository: IVesselRepository
        + GetAll(): Task
        + GetByImoNumber(imo: string): Task
        + Add(dto: VesselDTO, errors: List): Task
        + Update(imo: string, dto: VesselDTO, errors: List): Task
        + Search(filters): Task
        - ValidateImoFormat(imo: string): bool
    }

    interface IVesselService {
        + GetAll(): Task
        + Add(dto: VesselDTO, errors: List): Task
        + Update(imo: string, dto: VesselDTO, errors: List): Task
    }

    class VesselDTO <<DTO>> {
        + ImoNumber: string
        + Name: string
        + VesselType: string
        + Operator: string
        + ToDTO(v: Vessel): VesselDTO
        + ToDomain(dto: VesselDTO): Vessel
        + UpdateToDomain(vessel: Vessel, dto: VesselDTO): Vessel
    }
}

' ===== Domain Layer (Aggregates, Entities, Value Objects) =====
package "Domain Layer" #87CEEB {
    class Vessel <<Aggregate Root>> {
        + Id: long
        - _imoNumber: string
        - _name: string
        - _vesselType: string
        - _operator: string
        + ImoNumber: string
        + Name: string
        + VesselType: string
        + Operator: string
        + Vessel(imo, name, type, operator)
        + Update(name, type, operator): void
        + IsValidImoNumber(imo: string): bool
        - ValidateInvariants(): void
    }

    interface IVesselRepository <<Repository Interface>> {
        + GetAllAsync(): Task
        + GetByImoNumberAsync(imo: string): Task
        + Add(vessel: Vessel): Task
        + Update(vessel: Vessel, errors): Task
        + Exists(imo: string): Task
        + SearchAsync(imo, name, operator): Task
    }
}

' ===== Infrastructure Layer (Repositories & Persistence) =====
package "Infrastructure Layer" #87CEEB {
    class VesselRepository <<Repository>> {
        - _context: AbsanteeContext
        - _mapper: VesselMapper
        + GetAllAsync(): Task
        + GetByImoNumberAsync(imo: string): Task
        + Add(vessel: Vessel): Task
        + Update(vessel: Vessel, errors): Task
        + Exists(imo: string): Task
        + SearchAsync(filters): Task
    }

    class VesselDataModel <<Entity>> {
        + Id: long
        + ImoNumber: string
        + Name: string
        + VesselType: string
        + Operator: string
    }

    class VesselMapper <<Mapper>> {
        + ToDomain(dm: VesselDataModel): Vessel
        + ToDataModel(v: Vessel): VesselDataModel
        + UpdateDataModel(v: Vessel, dm: VesselDataModel): void
    }

    class AbsanteeContext <<Context>> {
        + Vessels: DbSet
        + VesselTypes: DbSet
        + SaveChangesAsync(): Task
        + OnModelCreating(modelBuilder): void
    }
}

' ===== Relationships =====
VesselsController --> IVesselService : uses
VesselsController ..> VesselDTO : receives/returns

VesselService ..|> IVesselService : implements
VesselService --> IVesselRepository : uses
VesselService ..> Vessel : manipulates
VesselService ..> VesselDTO : receives/returns

VesselDTO ..> Vessel : maps to/from

IVesselRepository <|.. VesselRepository : implements
VesselRepository --> AbsanteeContext : uses
VesselRepository --> VesselMapper : uses
VesselRepository ..> Vessel : returns
VesselRepository ..> VesselDataModel : queries/persists

VesselMapper ..> Vessel : creates
VesselMapper ..> VesselDataModel : creates

AbsanteeContext *-- VesselDataModel : manages

note right of Vessel
  **Aggregate Root**
  Enforces business rules:
  - IMO number: 7 digits with valid check digit
  - Name, Type, Operator: required, non-empty
  - IMO is immutable (business key)
  
  **US 2.2.2 - Create:**
  1. Validate IMO format and uniqueness
  2. Create Vessel aggregate
  3. Persist via repository
  
  **US 2.2.2 - Update:**
  1. Retrieve by IMO (immutable key)
  2. Update mutable fields
  3. Persist changes
end note

note right of VesselService
  **Application Service**
  Orchestrates:
  - Use case coordination
  - DTO validation
  - Repository operations
  - Error collection
  - Transactional boundaries
end note

note right of VesselRepository
  **Repository**
  Responsibilities:
  - Abstracts data access
  - Maps domain to data models
  - Handles EF Core operations
  - Returns pure domain objects
end note

